    "details": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<p>VIBETHON is a fast-paced vibe coding hackathon by ENCIDE MACE, challenging participants to turn ideas into functional products within a short timeframe. The event encourages creative experimentation and rapid development using modern AI-powered tools and agents to accelerate ideation, design, coding, and problem-solving. With a focus on building rather than over-planning, VIBETHON creates an energetic environment where participants can explore new approaches, push their creativity, and transform simple ideas into working solutions.</p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>VIBETHON 2026 is an 8-hour overnight hackathon at Mar Athanasius College of Engineering, where creativity meets AI-powered innovation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong></p>\n<p>16th October 2026, 6 PM &rarr; 17th October 2026, 10 AM</p>\n<p><strong>Venue:</strong></p>\n<p>Mar Athanasius College of Engineering, Kothamangalam, Ernakulam, Kerala, India</p>\n<p>Unlike long multi-day events, VIBETHON packs the thrill into a single sprint with three structured phases: Ideation &rarr; Design &rarr; Build.</p>\n<p><strong>Teams of 1&ndash;3 members </strong>will craft their most viable product, fueled by culture, food, and fun along the way.</p>",
